      "locked": false,
      "index": "b0b",
      "containerId": "arch-desc",
      "text": "Hybrid DeltaNet + Attention\n\nQwen3.5 uses a mixed architecture:\n- DeltaNet layers: linear attention O(n)\n  \u2014 efficient for long contexts\n- Standard full attention: quadratic O(n\u00b2)\n  \u2014 precise global attention\n\nPattern: 3x DeltaNet + 1x Full Attention\n(repeating throughout the model)\n\nAll sizes (9B/4B/2B/0.8B) use this\nhybrid pattern with ChatML template\n(same as Qwen3).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "layer-pattern-label",
